
-- Memory Basics - Learn Moringa's Remember and Recall
-- This tutorial demonstrates how Moringa bots can store and retrieve information
--
-- Try: "hello", "did I say hello", "teach me", "what do you know"

-- Store that user said hello
Recognizer "hello"
	Remember "User has greeted me"
	Option Say "Hello! I'll remember that you greeted me."

-- Check if user greeted before
Recognizer "did i say hello"
	Recall "User has greeted me"
	Option Say "Yes, you did say hello to me."

-- Store a lesson
Recognizer "teach me"
	Remember "User wants to learn"
	Option Say "I'll remember that you want to learn!"

-- Recall what we know
Recognizer "what do you know"
	Option Recall "User has greeted me"
	Option Recall "User wants to learn"

-- Help command
Recognizer "help"
	Option Say "Try: 'hello', 'did i say hello', 'teach me', 'what do you know'"

